{"4583130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Park It!", "steam_appid": 4583130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Variety of Parking Zones to Explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each stage offers new challenges, including winding alleys, obstacles, and tight parking spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single or Multiplayer Modes</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on all the controls by yourself, or split the roles with friends online or locally. Supports up to 4 players, with the difficulty and the fun multiplying based on player count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Split Controls &amp; Physics Engine</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A car's controls aren't bundled into one. Forward, reverse, and steering are each assigned to individual players, moving according to real physics. Only perfectly timed communication guarantees an accident-free park.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Control Schemes Supported</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with keyboard (WASD), or connect local controllers so several people can play on a single PC. Grab your friends, sit on the couch, and start the chaotic parking war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards &amp; Achievements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Leaderboards are broken down by stage and by player count. Compete with players worldwide to see which combo parks the fastest and most precisely.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Variety of Parking Zones to Explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each stage offers new challenges, including winding alleys, obstacles, and tight parking spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single or Multiplayer Modes</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on all the controls by yourself, or split the roles with friends online or locally. Supports up to 4 players, with the difficulty and the fun multiplying based on player count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Split Controls &amp; Physics Engine</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A car's controls aren't bundled into one. Forward, reverse, and steering are each assigned to individual players, moving according to real physics. Only perfectly timed communication guarantees an accident-free park.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Control Schemes Supported</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with keyboard (WASD), or connect local controllers so several people can play on a single PC. Grab your friends, sit on the couch, and start the chaotic parking war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards &amp; Achievements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Leaderboards are broken down by stage and by player count. Compete with players worldwide to see which combo parks the fastest and most precisely.</p>", "short_description": "Online 4-player co-op parking game — one WASD key each!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Greek, Dutch, Norwegian, Danish, Russian, Romanian, Vietnamese, Bulgarian, Swedish, Spanish - Latin America, Arabic, Ukrainian, Indonesian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Czech, Thai, Turkish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Polish, Finnish, Hungarian, Korean, Malay", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4583130/92565f86ae9b653f6de032edb8f5a2d60c968f47/header.jpg?t=1785497233", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4583130/1c1112630de2fc6f71ccfbfc1b66af8f7c012288/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785497233", "capsul